# Harness git branch = `main` only

When editing or shipping workspace harness / DPI test tooling:

| Paths | Branch |
|-------|--------|
| `scripts/dpic/**` | **`main`** → `origin/main` |
| `scripts/bin/dpi-sanity.sh` | **`main`** |
| DPI prep in `scripts/lib/agent-ops-lib.sh` | **`main`** |
| `cursor-bundle/memory/feedback_dpic_harness_gotchas.md` | **`main`** |

**Do not** push harness-only commits to `mfi_integration_v3.4.2.4` (or any train). If a harness fix landed on a train branch by mistake → cherry-pick onto `main` and push `main`.

Before push: `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD` must be **`main`**.

Memory: `cursor-bundle/memory/feedback_harness_push_origin_main_only.md`
